                           "name":  "AADS controlled-demo artifacts v1.1.1",
                           "body":  "## AADS controlled-demo artifacts v1.1.1\n\nEvidence-bound portfolio release for eight crop/part SD-LoRA adapter groups.\n\n- 64 checksum-pinned assets across 8 targets\n- complete per-target model cards with recorded ID/OOD metrics\n- frozen controlled-demo result: 48/48 expected decisions\n- independent production-readiness result: 0/8 adapters passed\n- cross-platform LF contract for byte-identical evidence validation on Windows and Linux\n\nThe 48-row result is a curated recorded CUDA run, not fresh inference or a field-performance estimate. Every adapter remains `production_ready=false` and `deployable=false`. Use the repository manifest to verify exact sizes and SHA-256 digests. DINOv3-derived files remain subject to the included DINOv3 license.",
